              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Armed with a hand weapon, thrusting spear, lamellar armour and barding. May have bow (+3 pts). May count rank bonus of up to +1 even though cavalry. (The Art of War p.75)</characteristic>
