  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="3e8f-2dcf-e8ff-9a4b" name="Eastern Steppe Nomads: Xianbei (Art of War) - List Notes" publicationId="b792-78e1-7b03-d4d6" hidden="false">
      <description>XIANBEI (The Art of War, pp.74-75). Special rule: Eastern Shock Cavalry (see the Art of War rules). Allies documented only: Wuhuan from the Eastern Steppe Nomads list. Percentage limits are by points. "May only have one selected option per 1,000 points" for Special Units is documented only.

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Xianbei]
  Characters: up to 25%
  Cavalry: up to 100%
  Infantry: up to 25%
  Special Units: up to 25%
  XIANBEI. Characters up to 25%. Cavalry: any amount. Infantry up to 25%. Special Units up to 25% (one selected option per 1,000 points). May have up to 25% Allies instead of selected options: Wuhuan Allies from the Eastern Steppe Nomads list (documented only).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
